      "title": "Letterboxd review of Cure",
      "snippet": "[Letterboxd Review of \"Cure\"] Early on you’re like “I would never fall for this shit. I would somehow resist it” and then you’re glued to the scene where he spills the water in the doctor’s office and you’re like “ah shit he’d get me in a second. I’d probably even try to squeeze in a second kill before I got caught.”",
